<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summon Fire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 30)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast summon fire</a>
</pre>
<p>In a flash of fire and light, a small fire elemental (level 45) emerges to 
serve you, the strongest of the four elementals. It follows you, fights 
beside you when you are in a fight, and when your hit points drop below a 
third it tries to rescue you.
</p><p>It can only stay on this plane a short time: from half a minute to a minute 
and a half, longer the better your summoning sphere. Then it vanishes in a 
puff of smoke, dropping whatever it carried. If it is killed first, it is 
gone too. It doesn't take orders.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Earth</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Air</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Water</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>